---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/pageContent';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Millennium Dev Labs"
  description="Our privacy policy details how we collect, protect, and handle client inquiries and website data."
>
  <section class="relative w-full bg-[#0F172A] text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-2">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">chevron_right</span>
        <span class="text-white">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl my-10 p-8 shadow-sm">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit an inquiry form or contact us via WhatsApp or phone, we collect only the information you voluntarily provide: your name, email address, phone number, and project requirements. We do not require customer accounts or passwords.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p>
        Your contact details and project briefs are used exclusively to evaluate your requirements, provide project quotations, and communicate directly regarding your software development engagement. We never sell, rent, or distribute your personal details to third-party marketers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Database Security &amp; Storage</h2>
      <p>
        All customer inquiries are stored in secure Supabase PostgreSQL databases fortified with Row Level Security (RLS) policies. Only authenticated administrators have access to inquiry records.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Media &amp; Cloudinary Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Images and media uploaded for client website projects are stored in secure Cloudinary CDN infrastructure with HTTPS delivery.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Contact Regarding Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this privacy policy or would like us to remove your submitted inquiry from our database, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="text-emerald-600 font-bold underline">{siteConfig.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
